              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi inkosi yakhe isizwile amazwi omkayo eyawakhuluma kuyo, yathi: “Yenze njalo kimi incekukazi yakho; ukuthi ulaka lwakhe lwavutha.",
          "type": "text",
